  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Reproductive Health System Focusing on Adolescence and Quality of Child Health Service in Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Strenthening Capacity Building(BEmONC Training, New Midwife Training, MDSR(Maternal Death Surveillance and Response) Training) 2. Support of Integrated Outreach Service 3. Strenghening Governance and leadership, 4. Infrastructure strengthning, 5. Community based-Nutrition Promotion Initiative based on community (Luang Namtha), 6. Cross Cutting Community Approach  for Adolescent Sexual and Reproductive Health (Udomxay)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the reproductive health status and reduce maternal, neonatal and child mortality and morbidity including malnutrition in three Northen Provinces of  Laos&#xB77C;&#xC624;&#xC2A4; &#xBD81;&#xBD80; 3&#xAC1C; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC758; &#xBAA8;&#xC790;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC9C8; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1; &#xBC0F; &#xC778;&#xC801; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;, &#xB77C;&#xC624;&#xC2A4; &#xBD81;&#xBD80; 3&#xAC1C; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC758; &#xBAA8;&#xC790;&#xBCF4;&#xAC74;&#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xC131; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;, &#xC601;&#xC720;&#xC544;&#xC758; &#xC801;&#xC808;&#xD55C; &#xC601;&#xC591;&#xC12D;&#xCDE8; &#xC99D;&#xC9C4; (&#xB8E8;&#xC559;&#xB0A8;&#xD0C0;), &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144;&#xC758;&#x3000;&#xC62C;&#xBC14;&#xB978; &#xC131; &#xC778;&#xC2DD; &#xD568;&#xC591; (&#xC6B0;&#xB3D4;&#xC2F8;&#xC774;)</narrative>
